HOI4 Live Tools reads and drives Hearts of Iron IV, a trademark of Paradox Interactive AB. It is an independent
tool: no game file is copied or redistributed, and it is not affiliated with or endorsed by Paradox Interactive.
Windows.Media.Ocr, used for screen text, is part of Windows.

FEX translation research:
  FEX-Emu/FEX — https://github.com/FEX-Emu/FEX (MIT), tag FEX-2610.
  LinuxSyscalls/Syscalls.cpp, LinuxSyscalls/x64/Thread.cpp and
  FEXInterpreter/ELFCodeLoader.h were consulted for guest exec and auxiliary
  vector semantics. The explicit translated-process ownership checks are new
  project code. No FEX source, binary or root filesystem is redistributed.

